  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programmet baserat p&#xe5; projektf&#xf6;rslag fr&#xe5;n SDI. Insatsen kritisk f&#xf6;r   SDI utveckling. SDI har f&#xe5;tt en dramatisk &#xf6;kning av medlemsantalet    och saknar tillr&#xe4;ckligt m&#xe5;nga kompetenta. Insatsen st&#xf6;djer            genomf&#xf6;randet av UPFI (PLUS 54040066)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This program is based on a specific request to Sida from SDI. The     capacity-building programme is absolutely critical for SDIs           institutional evolution. Dramatic influx of members of SDI lately and the org is extremely short of competent staff. This contribution      indirectly support UPFI (PLUS 54040066)</narrative>
  </description>
